(b) Find the area of the triangle using Heron''s formula. *(3 marks)*

(c) Hence find the radius of the incircle and the circumcircle. *(5 marks)*

---

## SECTION 3: LOGARITHMS, COMPLEX NUMBERS AND DIFFERENTIATION

