B. $\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt{x}}$  
C. $2\sqrt{x}$  
D. $\dfrac{1}{\sqrt{x}}$  

---

**Q45.** The area under $y = x$ from $x = 0$ to $x = 2$ is:

A. 3  
B. 4  
C. 2  
D. 1  

---

**Q46.** A maximum point has:

