**Q52.** $\int \dfrac{1}{x^2}\,dx$ is:

A. $-\dfrac{1}{x} + c$  
B. $\ln x + c$  
C. $-x + c$  
D. $\dfrac{1}{x} + c$  

---

**Q53.** The turning point of $y = x^2 - 2x$ is:

A. (1, -1)  
B. (2, 0)  
C. (-1, 3)  
D. (1, 1)  

